{"seq":3,"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry","introMarkdown":"# 化学 简介\n\n大学化学是在分子和原子层面理解物质性质、结构和变化规律的科学。从原子轨道的量子力学描述到有机反应的机理推导，从热力学对反应方向的预测到分析技术对未知物质的鉴定，化学为理解从生命过程到材料设计的广泛现象提供了核心的分子视角。\n\n与高中化学侧重记忆化学式和配平方程式不同，大学化学强调从原理出发理解化学现象的\"为什么\"。为什么金刚石极硬而石墨很软？因为碳原子的杂化方式不同导致了截然不同的晶体结构。为什么有些反应需要加热催化而另一些在室温下瞬间完成？热力学和动力学的分析能给出定量的回答。这种从现象到原理的思维方式是大学化学的核心。\n\n第一章**普通化学**从原子结构和化学键出发，建立理解化学现象的基本概念框架，涵盖化学平衡、酸碱理论和氧化还原等核心主题。第二章**有机化学**以碳骨架化合物为研究对象，探讨官能团的反应性、反应机理和立体化学，这是理解生物分子和药物设计的基础。第三章**物理化学**运用热力学、动力学和量子化学的理论工具深入分析化学过程的能量和速率，是化学学科中最具理论深度的分支。第四章**分析化学**介绍光谱法、色谱法和电化学分析等现代分析技术，培养鉴定和定量分析物质的实验能力。\n\n建议在学习理论的同时关注化学实验——即使无法亲自操作，通过视频和虚拟实验室了解实验过程也很有价值。化学是一门实验科学，理论理解和实验直觉的结合才是完整的化学素养。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"general-chemistry","title":"普通化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/general-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-structure","title":"原子结构与化学键","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/general-chemistry/atomic-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-equilibrium","title":"化学平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-equilibrium"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chemical-kinetics","title":"化学动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-kinetics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"organic-chemistry","title":"有机化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/organic-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrocarbons","title":"烃类化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/organic-chemistry/hydrocarbons"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functional-groups","title":"官能团化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/organic-chemistry/functional-groups"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reaction-mechanisms","title":"有机反应机理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"physical-chemistry","title":"物理化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/physical-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-chemistry","title":"量子化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thermochemistry","title":"热化学与化学热力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/physical-chemistry/thermochemistry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electrochemistry","title":"电化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/physical-chemistry/electrochemistry"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"analytical-chemistry","title":"分析化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/analytical-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spectroscopy","title":"光谱分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/spectroscopy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chromatography","title":"色谱分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/chromatography"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantitative-analysis","title":"定量分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/quantitative-analysis"}]}]}